{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510182","name":"宵宫【彩蛋】","desc":"宵宫彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/3499b3570093135494b5c9a0a2e4df0b_387405478241013481.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e「长野原烟花店」店长，「夏祭的女王」，将人们的愿望寄托于烟花中的能工巧匠。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/43014af35ae9c4cdf19a8323aa04a0a9_3259386048868037810.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e6月21日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e长野原烟花店\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/02/50494840/ebe165adc48ebdf7f20a36b87010519a_5659288085557589174.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"9s7bpk3e3vlT1772465542148\",\"child_ids\":{\"9s7bpk3e3vlT1772465542148\":[]},\"contents\":{\"0iu9xju9ydpeT1772687808472\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：还有重拳出击鸭。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"2lydxahyt1gT1772687756659\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：好像听到了熟人的名字…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e为宵宫简单介绍了爱诺和伊涅芙和叮铃眶哪蛋卷工坊的一切…\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：那位爱诺，是一个小孩子？而且她之前一直独自住在工坊里，现在所有的「家人」，实际上都是她自己制造出来的?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：我邻居的孩子，哪怕一个人呆一晚上也要委屈得哭个不停，要父母安慰好久才能好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：看那夏镇的人对她的态度，也已经把她看做了成熟的机械师，根本没有把她作为一个需要陪伴的小孩子看待。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：但爱诺她…在伊涅芙出现之前，又究竟一个人，呆了多少个晚上呢？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"7pooql0g559T1772687558613\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫：我刚刚从希汐岛那边回来，整个岛的颜色都非常好看！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：要是烟花也能做出这种感觉就好了。我拍了几张画片，方便回去之后参考。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9s7bpk3e3vlT1772465542148\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"a2nrxkenw5vT1772687807380\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：现在有伊涅芙陪着她了。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"bu25lshiiviT1772687458438\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：宵宫？怎么在这里？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫：哇哈，旅行者！居然在这里遇到了你，今天是我的幸运日吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：我来这边旅游呢，嘿嘿。之前和你一起去须弥游玩了一圈之后，做烟花做得更快更好了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：最近烟火生意刚刚好在淡季，给家里备好了货之后，我就自己出来玩啦，也顺便找找灵感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：赶在夏天到来之前，我可要好好玩个痛快。等我带着灵感回去的时候，做烟花的效率肯定也能大大提升呢！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fy6gxgaxiaaT1772687557744\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：接下来有计划吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"te74vp9lknT1772687552364\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：有找到灵感吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"u1tavv4hq7T1772687810213\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫：嗯…虽然之前的事情没办法改变了，但现在既然我来了…就要陪爱诺好好玩一场！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：果然随身带着工具是一个正确的选择。我这就去那夏镇借用一下工具台，给爱诺做一个漂漂亮亮的礼物。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：做什么好呢…烟花？手鞠？还是陀螺…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：好，干脆全部做一遍吧！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xvh08q1sj2pT1772687562127\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫：见到你太开心了，一下子差点忘了。有的有的！我已经想好啦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：我一路走走逛逛，灵感已经找得差不多了。接下来就是给家里人还有街坊邻居带些小礼物了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：看，我给老爹买了一些这边的鱼干，给老妈带的是夏槲果果酱，都是这边的特产。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"yhxd2xte8rT1772687809079\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：和工坊里的大家。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zauztd08jcoT1772687565012\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：看着都很不错嘛！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e宵宫：是吧！但是，给孩子们的礼物我倒是还没买到，不过我已经打听好了，这边有一位叫做爱诺的机械师…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：这位机械师可厉害了，听说这座大炮就是她造的呢！我打算过去拜访一下她，看看能不能给孩子们定做点好玩的东西。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：不过我听说这位机械师比较随心所欲，就算是给了摩拉也不是所有订单都接的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵宫：我要不要在上门之前带些什么东西呢？就是不知道她喜欢什么…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"znnpuap6cljT1772465542162\",\"child_ids\":{\"znnpuap6cljT1772465542162\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"ozo29ay4ptqT1772465542177\",\"child_ids\":{\"ozo29ay4ptqT1772465542177\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"m4a2m6xz58T1772465542180\",\"child_ids\":{\"m4a2m6xz58T1772465542180\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"我的生日…——2022-06-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e今晚有空吗？我准备了好多造型独特的烟花，就等天黑之后放呢！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽然整体规模不大，但每一枚烟花都有特别的意义。有我过往一年里最得意的作品，还有最近刚研制出的妖怪图案…哎呀，一不小心说漏嘴了！透露太多会没有惊喜感的，希望你亲自来看！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我很喜欢给别人过生日，因为能为大家带来欢乐和笑容。而到了今天，在我打开糖果盒的时候，孩子们从路边窜了出来，一起喊着「宵宫姐姐生日快乐」…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e哇，实在是太开心了！真想天天过生日！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我把糖果分给了每个人，留下了最后三粒，等着和你还有派蒙一起吃哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"777\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/13/24077343/098cd7462a566c5ebb8d17d39bab79d6_2774656492092502168.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"糖\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/777/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/777/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e糖\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"夏祭游鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e夏祭游鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2768\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/6b0019fab64cca9709cea3fab2087ea6_5440701559117076828.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"日落鲷鱼烧\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2768/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2768/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e日落鲷鱼烧\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/27f2a0632a6e8578e50ca22755b58069_8872480911078214104.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/27f2a0632a6e8578e50ca22755b58069_8872480911078214104.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/24433218\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e宫生日快乐｜嘿嘿，那么，该放烟花咯——\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"大妖怪！——2023-06-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e听孩子们说，最近山里出现了一只大妖怪！它体型庞大，笑声可怖，平日里爱吃甜点心，放在篮子里的团子一眨眼就不见了。它还特别爱抢大家手里的糖果，连糖纸都不放过，可以说是作恶多端。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但是，黏糊糊的甜点心吃得太多，大妖怪的行动正在变得迟缓。孩子们又说，只要无敌的英雄宵宫姐姐出手，一定能将它轻松讨伐：只要讨伐了这只妖怪，它的肚子里就会出现一个大大的蛋糕，还带蜡烛！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e你一定也没见过这种妖怪吧？想不想和我一起去讨伐它？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我来接你吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"777\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/13/24077343/098cd7462a566c5ebb8d17d39bab79d6_2774656492092502168.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"糖\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/777/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/777/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e糖\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"夏祭游鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e夏祭游鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2420\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/3253b8c5ef8b8027585973c7ad5336a9_5249019741159477569.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"绯樱饼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2420/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2420/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e绯樱饼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/4a2c7c61fc077d2b4651fcfc98cd97c0_8729296205597792619.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/4a2c7c61fc077d2b4651fcfc98cd97c0_8729296205597792619.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/40538538\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e宵宫生日快乐｜看，就是这里啦！\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"捧星星…——2024-06-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e前阵子孩子们想去参加试胆大会，但又怕黑，我就去树林里捕来萤火虫，给他们做了几盏小夜灯。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e萤火虫一闪一闪的样子，就像是把星星捧在掌心一样呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我突然有了灵感，想做一种能拿在手里的、星星外形的烟花…嘿嘿，经过连日的尝试，终于大功告成了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e以后当你走夜路的时候，就点燃一支「星星烟花」吧，这样「英雄形态」的宵宫姐姐就会给你力量——哎呀，我知道你不是小孩子啦，只是希望我的新发明，能在你的旅途中绽放小小的光芒。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e好啦，快来和我一起「捧星星」吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"738\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/61ed7bb52bcedc1141cdf955a4d93921_3907280891124625478.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"发光髓\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/738/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/738/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e发光髓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"夏祭游鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e夏祭游鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/3da9d21e120201b6f00321678e8d778b_1193091012487869880.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/3da9d21e120201b6f00321678e8d778b_1193091012487869880.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/54064280\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e宵宫生日快乐｜嘿嘿，我希望它比向流星许愿还要灵验~\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"幸福瞬间！——2025-06-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e这些天在为「长野原烟花会」跑前跑后，都没留意老爹早就把我的生日礼物准备好了，是一台留影机耶！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e试燃烟花时我从取景框里观察…夜空中的火花映照着情侣们眼中的泪花，老婆婆温柔地用手盖住小猫的耳朵，孩子们举着三彩团子和烟花图案比谁更圆，噗！最后团子粘在鼻尖上…我的烟花作为背景融入了这些幸福瞬间，一起被定格…翻看画片时我心中也有东西被点燃了，我想，这就是我坚持做烟花的意义吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e说起来，印象中每次跟你在一起看烟花，我的注意力都在天上…这一次，我想看看你的反应！好不好好不好？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘻嘻，等你来！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"夏祭游鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e夏祭游鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2318\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/15568211/bec41ca24fbc0e42b4280abfd6aad533_1864903025890334673.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「浮世」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2318/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2318/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「浮世」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/35e38b73805c2134070994ada2689a82_2505763554228633491.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/35e38b73805c2134070994ada2689a82_2505763554228633491.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/65576696\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e宵宫生日快乐｜派蒙要尝一颗看看吗？喏，这颗黄色的给你~\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"「天下第一好」阵营！——2026-06-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e嘿嘿，猜猜看这阵子我跟谁碰面了？是可莉哦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e她和早柚带了几位没见过的小朋友来长野原找我玩。听可莉说，现在她们可都是厉害的「小魔女」了？真厉害呀。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这几天我们一起放烟花、玩游戏，开心得不得了！同为正义的盟友，我们一致赞同，「英雄姐姐」跟「小魔女」绝对是天下第一好！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e为表纪念，大家找来许多亮闪闪的贝壳，我给小魔女们都做了漂亮的小发饰。考虑到你和派蒙常在外冒险，我们特地做了份既实用又能传达热情的纪念品，希望可以温暖你们。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e没错，你们当然也有份！因为你们俩，可一直都在我们这个「天下第一好」的阵营里嘛！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"夏祭游鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e夏祭游鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1379\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/12/23/15568211/b7c94c7458780d2a211accb0d0a55d7e_2576917838791002881.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"放热瓶\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1379/detail?bbs_presentatio